>: Synthetic events l=C3=A0 wrapper around native events</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Proxy Pattern</strong>:=
 React acts as proxy gi=E1=BB=AFa native events v=C3=A0 component handlers<=
/li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Facade Pattern</strong>=
